{"5266240":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Potato Please","steam_appid":5266240,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5391760],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, Comrade. The nation has entrusted you with a vital responsibility: keeping the army fed. Peel the potatoes, prepare the supply, and improve your operation in service of the greater good. Work hard, work efficiently, and remember: the army is hungry.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.poster.avif?t=1793717995\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.webm?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.mp4?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>PEEL THE POTATOES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is simple: peel the potatoes and get them into the water.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick them up, peel them by hand, and toss them in one by one.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.poster.avif?t=1793717995\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.webm?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.mp4?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>FINISH THE PILE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear the pile and find faster ways to get the job done.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as manual work gradually turns into a much more efficient operation.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.poster.avif?t=1793717995\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.webm?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.mp4?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>AUTOMATE THE PROCESS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn repetitive work into a system.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect potatoes in bulk, use machines to process them, and automate more of the job as your operation grows.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, Comrade. The nation has entrusted you with a vital responsibility: keeping the army fed. Peel the potatoes, prepare the supply, and improve your operation in service of the greater good. Work hard, work efficiently, and remember: the army is hungry.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.poster.avif?t=1793717995\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.webm?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/165fc28ca8387d7d593ce5e68c697c54.mp4?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>PEEL THE POTATOES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is simple: peel the potatoes and get them into the water.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick them up, peel them by hand, and toss them in one by one.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.poster.avif?t=1793717995\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.webm?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/01513a741a2cb2fe3b43c35d8b0d994b.mp4?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>FINISH THE PILE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear the pile and find faster ways to get the job done.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as manual work gradually turns into a much more efficient operation.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.poster.avif?t=1793717995\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.webm?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/extras\/7c159d378dd32eb6ecbf3f70cccac190.mp4?t=1793717995\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>AUTOMATE THE PROCESS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn repetitive work into a system.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect potatoes in bulk, use machines to process them, and automate more of the job as your operation grows.<\/p>","short_description":"A first-person potato peeling game. You have a knife. You have a bucket. You have a mountain of potatoes. Peel them with real physics. Cut thin, waste nothing. Buy better tools. Finish the pile.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Polish, Hungarian, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Czech, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/e289442aa6b3756109bc65b427556ea538efb849\/header.jpg?t=1793717995","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/b01dc513eb9df69b0944e4a2f2d9e628ec53ac0d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793717995","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5266240\/b01dc513eb9df69b0944e4a2f2d9e628ec53ac0d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793717995","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"DISCLAIMER<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\nPotato Please is a work of fiction. All nations, institutions, characters, and events depicted in the game are fictional and do not represent any real-world government or political organization.<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\n© 2026 Golden Horn Studios. All rights reserved.","developers":[" Golden Horn Studios"],"publishers":[" Golden Horn Studios"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":899,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$9.99","final_formatted":"$8.99"},"packages":[1821103],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Potato Please","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1821103,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Potato Please - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99<\/span> $8.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":899}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Ti